== b11_match
  san:    exit 134 use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written|
  O3:     exit 0 match 12|
  interp: exit 1 olang interpret: b11_match.olang:33: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/b11_match.debug.san
--- run san
use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written
--- run O3
match 12
--- interpret
olang interpret: b11_match.olang:33: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed
